Not affiliated with anyone
--------------------------

This project is an independent, unofficial recreation. It is **not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or connected to Nintendo**, Source Research & Development,
Fabtek Inc., Montague-Weston, or any successor of those companies.

"WorkBoy", "Game Boy", "Game Boy Color" and "Game Boy Advance" are used purely
descriptively, to identify the historical device this project recreates and the
consoles it attaches to. No claim is made to any trademark.

For the record: the WorkBoy mark (USPTO serial 74239332, filed 1992-01-22) was
**abandoned on 1994-04-21** without ever registering — an intent-to-use
application that lapsed when the product was never released. Source Research &
Development and Fabtek Inc. are both defunct.


What is NOT in this repository
------------------------------

The original 1992 WorkBoy cartridge ROM is leaked, copyrighted, Nintendo-licensed
code. It is **not** included here, is excluded by .gitignore, and must never be
committed or distributed. Use it only for private bench reference, if at all.

Also deliberately excluded: The Cutting Room Floor reference PDFs, and the
bundled third-party emulator sources used locally for validation (GBE+, SameBoy).
Each of those carries its own licence and upstream home.

The cartridge software in `rom/` is **clean-room**: written from the documented
wire protocol, containing no leaked code or assets.


